Modification notice (2026-10-15)
------------------------------
Browsless is a modified version of Automa, not an official Automa release.
Changes include the Browsless identity, a WXT-based Chrome Manifest V3 build,
TypeScript migration, local-first application structure, dependency updates,
and interface/theme changes. This summary is not an exhaustive change history;
see the repository history and corresponding source for individual changes.

